{"text": "EGEIVE\nee NOV 1 7 1092\n\noe\n\nPHILIP MORRIS /THOMAS J. COLLAMORE\n\nCOMPANIES INC.\n120 PARK AVENUE, NEW YORK, N.Y. 10017-5582 + TELEPHONE (212\n\n30-5000\n\nNovember 13, 1992\n\nMr. Thomas J. Collamore Ploy\nVice President - Corporate Afaits\\& Administration\nPhilip Morris Companies Inc.\n120 Park Avenue\nNew York, NY 10017\n\nDear Tom:\n\nYou ate cordially invited to attend the Philip Morris Worldwide\nLeadership Conference II, which will be held from Tuesday, February 2, through\nFriday, February 5, 1993, at the Hyatt Regency Scottsdale in Scottsdale,\nAtizona.\n\nThe primary objective of the conference will be to focus on ways to\nimprove the effectiveness of our marketing programs in the highly competitive\nenvironment of the 1990s. We believe you will find it to be an interesting and\nstimulating meeting, regardless of your current job function.\n\nSpecific material relative to the meeting, including R.S.V.P. information,\nis enclosed. We look forward to seeing you in February.\n\nSincerely,\n[hte Be.\n\nMichael A. Miles R. William Murray,\nChairman & Chief Executive Officer President & Chief Operating Officer\n\nTEPLOG PAZ", "words": [{"text": "EGEIVE", "x0": 600, "y0": 26, "x1": 710, "y1": 46, "conf": 73.0}, {"text": "ee", "x0": 391, "y0": 63, "x1": 444, "y1": 98, "conf": 67.0}, {"text": "NOV", "x0": 608, "y0": 60, "x1": 635, "y1": 96, "conf": 68.0}, {"text": "1", "x0": 647, "y0": 72, "x1": 650, "y1": 86, "conf": 66.0}, {"text": "7", "x0": 659, "y0": 72, "x1": 665, "y1": 86, "conf": 66.0}, {"text": "1092", "x0": 674, "y0": 60, "x1": 704, "y1": 96, "conf": 71.0}, {"text": "oe", "x0": 355, "y0": 104, "x1": 397, "y1": 111, "conf": 52.0}, {"text": "PHILIP", "x0": 285, "y0": 104, "x1": 388, "y1": 152, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "MORRIS", "x0": 399, "y0": 100, "x1": 522, "y1": 157, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "/THOMAS", "x0": 561, "y0": 115, "x1": 629, "y1": 135, "conf": 0.0}, {"text": "J.", "x0": 635, "y0": 115, "x1": 645, "y1": 131, "conf": 71.0}, {"text"